  "description": "Conversion of garage into a habitable room. Addition of an external colonnade to the rear elevation. First floor part front extension. Alterations to fenestrations and associated landscaping. (Summary)\n\nThe proposed works comprise the construction of a first-floor extension to the front of the property, together with the adjustment and reconfiguration of existing door and window openings on both the front and rear elevations. The existing garage to the front elevation will be converted into a habitable room. The works also include the addition of an external colonnade to the rear elevation, designed to provide passive solar shading and improve environmental performance.\n\nFurther proposals consist of general remedial and retrofit works throughout the property to upgrade the building and make it suitable for modern family living. External materials have been selected to respond sensitively to the building’s Art Deco influences and will include off-white render and aluminium-framed windows.\n\nThe development also includes the comprehensive re-landscaping of both the front and rear gardens.",
